It's theoretically possible to have Rodney only spawn once.

He's guaranteed to appear on Earth - except that if he's paralyzed, he
can't arrive there. So if you do everything else first, steal the Book
rather than kill him, let him follow you all the way through the asc run
(ouch!), then paralyze him on D:2, step away from him (so he doesn't
follow) and c!oGL twice, you'll get onto Earth without a reappearance.

This is not really advisable. But you can do it, if you want to. Might
make for quite the stupid ascension trick.

